- Ahem!

322
00:20:30.199 --> 00:20:34.399
I mean, she's good.
She's, really, a credit to her, but...

323
00:20:34.424 --> 00:20:36.698
you know ... You know.

324
00:20:36.723 --> 00:20:39.075
With great respect,
let's not test the whole,

325
00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:43.416
'insurance-will-pay-for-everything' idea,
